### ==========================================
### 席位 Position CRUD
### ==========================================

### 获取所有席位
GET http://localhost:3205/api/positions

### 获取单个席位
GET http://localhost:3205/api/positions/1

### 创建席位
POST http://localhost:3205/api/positions
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "东塔台",
    "description": "东塔台管制席位"
}

### 更新席位
PUT http://localhost:3205/api/positions/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "西塔台",
    "description": "西塔台管制席位"
}

### 删除席位
DELETE http://localhost:3205/api/positions/1
